; Env-gated live integration suite (DESIGN §12.4), Lwt runtime. Exercises the
; real TLS+ALPN+OAuth stack against a live workspace across all interfaces (gRPC
; JSON/Proto streaming, REST insert, OTLP logs export). When the DATABRICKS_HOST /
; DATABRICKS_CLIENT_ID / DATABRICKS_CLIENT_SECRET / ZEROBUS_TEST_TABLE env vars are
; unset, every case is a clean no-op success, so it is safe to build/run anywhere.
; It links the Lwt gRPC/REST/OTLP packages; it is NOT in the normal CI test loop
; (a live run needs real credentials + a pre-created UC table).
